  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **While I’m Waiting Here > (1)** (2 other sources): Uploader's notes mark a first call tease attached to this segue point in the set [1][2]\n- **Nobody’s Love Is Like Mine (2)** (2 other sources): Jarrod Walker sang lead vocals on this song [1][2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Today**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Blue Mule (3)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-07-25.litz.neumannKM150.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 93 min [1]\n- **billystrings2019-07-25.travitz.litz.schoepsMK4v.flac16**: source not stated; 15 songs; 93 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-07-25.litz.neumannKM150.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Neumann KM150's>SD MixPre6 [1]. Also: Neumann KM150 mics in Section 102 Row M fed a Sound Devices MixPre-6 at 24-bit/96kHz, later downconverted to 16-bit/44.1kHz FLAC [1]\n- **billystrings2019-07-25.travitz.litz.schoepsMK4v.flac16**: taped by Jeff Travitz; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK4v's>KCY>VMS5u>SD744t [2]. Also: Schoeps MK4V mics through a KCY250/5i and VMS5u into a Sound Devices 744t, recorded 16-bit/44.1kHz from Section 102 Row N; only fades edited [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Peach Music Festival - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/peach-music-festival/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Peach Music Festival - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/peach-music-festival/) [5]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Peach Music Festival - Scranton, PA - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/peach-music-festival-scranton-pa/) [6]",
